spoon threads - keybindings

  Up/k          Move thread selection up
  Down/j        Move thread selection down
  q/ctrl+c      Quit
  r/Enter       Reply
  R             Resolve current thread
  a             Apply suggestion
  ctrl+a        Resolve all
  A             Unresolve all
  o             Open pull request
  c             Counter-propose
  ?             Toggle help
  f             Hide or restore chrome

In the composer:
  ctrl+s        Submit reply
  Esc           Cancel reply

Press ? again to return.
